function.description:
Prepare a change to an order or to the customer's default address. This does NOT make the change: it checks it and returns a summary to read to the customer. Only after the customer clearly says yes, call confirm_change with the change number. Pick one kind and give only its inputs:
- cancel_order: needs order_id, reason. Example: {"kind": "cancel_order", "order_id": "#W6247578", "reason": "no longer needed"}
- change_order_address: needs order_id, address. Example: {"kind": "change_order_address", "order_id": "#W6247578", "address": {"address1": "12 Main St", "address2": "Apt 4", "city": "Austin", "state": "TX", "country": "USA", "zip": "78701"}}
- change_order_payment: needs order_id, payment_method_id. Example: {"kind": "change_order_payment", "order_id": "#W6247578", "payment_method_id": "gift_card_1234567"}
- change_order_items: needs order_id, items, payment_method_id. Example: {"kind": "change_order_items", "order_id": "#W6247578", "items": [{"item_id": "item_3799046073", "new_item_id": "item_2060066974"}], "payment_method_id": "credit_card_9513926"}
- return_items: needs order_id, item_ids, payment_method_id. Example: {"kind": "return_items", "order_id": "#W2378156", "item_ids": ["item_1151293680"], "payment_method_id": "credit_card_9513926"}
- exchange_items: needs order_id, items, payment_method_id. Example: {"kind": "exchange_items", "order_id": "#W2378156", "items": [{"item_id": "item_4983901480", "new_item_id": "item_7747408585"}], "payment_method_id": "credit_card_9513926"}
- change_default_address: needs address. Example: {"kind": "change_default_address", "address": {"address1": "12 Main St", "address2": "", "city": "Austin", "state": "TX", "country": "USA", "zip": "78701"}}
For change_order_items and exchange_items, put EVERY item in one call: each order allows this only once. item_id / new_item_id come from get_order / find_replacement / find_variants. payment_method_id comes from verify_customer.
